      "translatedText": "| Scenario | Recommendation |\n|:---|:---|\n| Simple fixed parameters | Lambda or `bind` both work |\n| The parameter relationships need to be read very clearly | Lambda |\n| Binding a member function to an old interface | `bind` is very common, and a Lambda can also be used |\n| Requires complex logic, conditional judgment | Lambda |\n| Reading old code or ROS2/Boost.Asio examples | Must understand `bind` |",
